From c8e37aedc1c84c6de4e31cf232d9e7cf0e81833c Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Cursor Agent <cursoragent@cursor.com>
Date: Fri, 2 Oct 2026 13:00:04 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] fix(persistence): retire empty source with missing checkout
 (#5219)

Allow sources archive|remove --retire-missing-checkout when the canonical
checkout is already gone and the source has zero live pages, zero
soft-deleted pages, zero chunks, and no pending mirrors. Populated
sources, physical-identity stubs, and other lifecycle verbs stay closed.

Co-authored-by: Kkkkkuro <Kkkkkuro@users.noreply.github.com>
